issue_body:
#### Expected behavior
No error. Method call successfully

#### Actual behavior
`Returned error: VM Exception while processing transaction: revert`


#### Steps to reproduce the behavior

```ts
// create instance of the contract with provider data at initiation
const contractWithParams = new web3.eth.Contract(GreeterAbi, undefined, {
				provider: web3.provider,
				data: GreeterBytecode,
				from: localAccount.address,
				gas: '1000000',
}) as unknown as Contract<typeof GreeterAbi>;

// deploy contract
const deployedContract = await contractWithParams.deploy({ arguments: ['Hello World'] }).send();

// try to call any static method
await deployedContract.methods.greet().call()
```
